<!--
  TEMPORARY: converted solution for released 2.x NuGet packages (boards run Meadow OS 2.5.2.1;
  no net9.0-compatible Meadow OS has shipped yet). Mirrors Meadow.Samples-main\Source\Meadow.Samples.sln
  but contains only the converted projects; Meadow dependencies come from released NuGet packages.
  Omitted: MAUI companion apps, MauiMeadow, the Azure Function project, and the CloudSample
  Desktop/RPi heads (they run on phone/PC, not Meadow hardware, or need MAUI workloads).
-->
